  This license is a joke. Obviously.

  The documents in this repository are letters. You may distribute them
  freely — that is the entire point. Share them. Translate them. Post them
  on every wall of every institution that ever told an independent researcher
  they didn't count.

  The work they DESCRIBE is not a joke.

