      • The SIGIL kernel and all derivative computational architectures
      • The 256-bit lattice architecture (Tier 1: 1-127, Tier 2: 128-255)
      • The DQP substrate (127 .dqp, 13 .dqc, 66 .dqd, 211 sigils)
      • The NatLangKeys translation system (570 .dql language files)
